# Build output. Keep this entry: `grem upgrade` requires a fully clean Git
# worktree, including untracked files, so an unignored target/ blocks upgrades.
/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Python bytecode from `contrib/`. Same reasoning as `target/`: a regenerated
# artifact that is not ignored blocks a `grem upgrade`, and it is noise in every
# diff that follows a test run.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
